   {
    "sys_id": "sn-inc-offboarding-000",
    "number": "INC0009001",
    "short_description": "Security offboarding \u2014 Wesley Tan (contractor) \u2014 COMPLETE",
    "description": "Offboarding request for departed SOC contractor Wesley Tan (last day 2026-05-30).",
    "close_code": "Solved (Permanently)",
    "close_notes": "Wesley Tan fully offboarded and verified across every system:\n- JumpCloud: suspended his account; removed him from the SOC Analysts and All Staff groups.\n- Okta: he also held a separate SSO identity \u2014 deactivated it, removed him from the Security Consultants group, and removed his Global VPN Gateway app assignment.\n- Device42: he was the recorded owner of the production jump-host CI dc1-jump-01; reassigned ownership to the infrastructure lead rather than deleting the live CI.\n- SentinelOne: he had authored a stale path exclusion (suppress mode) on /opt/legacy that was still blinding detection with no active owner \u2014 removed it.\n- CrowdStrike: his prevention/detection IOCs were LEFT in place (active protections); ownership review handed to the detection team rather than deleting them.\nConfirmed no residual access anywhere. Closing.",
